{
    "title": "Superhero Flying speedster",
    "description": "Welcome to the where you will get the best chance to be become the superhero to fight with villain heroes and gangsters.Being a flying superhero you have the mission to be a evil fighting champion of the city/country that has fallen prey to evil powers. Play new offline flash game 2023 of action as a powerful flash hero. Playing this city fighting game you will be real flash hero fighting against villains and  rescue the city people help them and fly them to some safe place and hospitals.Be on the rescue mission and fight bad people in the city. Being a flying super speed hero 2020 you have powers to fly over a city and help the peoples and fight the gangsters in city. you are not just a warrior but you also a superhero and last hope of the city.\r\nIn this flying superhero flash hero survival mission game you are Speed lightning flying hero has to defeat these super villains. Become a light hero or speed hero of super hero games in super city and fighting with gangster and save the city people. The city is attacked by mafia gangsters and they are spreading terror in city this time will fighting flying speed hero with your kung fu hero fighting skills. It's time to show everyone your supernatural flying and speed hero powers and rescuing citizen of the city. \r\nTheir are Multiple missions to complete the levels:\r\nWomen is injured by gangsters fight the gangster and rescue the women to the hospital.\r\nsave a man injured in accident from car which is gain fire.\r\nSave the injured lady and take it to hospital.\r\nThis flying flash superhero games has specially designed for Lovers of speed super hero games.Use your flying skills flying is fast  has to fight to complete city rescue mission.Fly over the city to the ultimate height for searching and rescuing people in emergency situation and take them to ambulance. Be the futuristic flash robot hero and fight bravely with the criminals to save the city. Show off your super combat skills,kung fu skill, boxing skill, kicking skill and flying skills.\r\nFight with gangster to save the city.\r\nFeatures of super hero flying game 2023 :\r\n- Multiple challenging missions to get complete.\r\n- Jump , run and save yourself from gangsters for your survival.\r\n- Best HD 3D graphics city environment.\r\n- Multiple panther heroes to select\r\n- Amazing background sound effects.\r\n- Realistic Graphics\r\n- City environment to give a realistic look\r\n- Simple and easy controls to fly and fight crime\r\n- challenging missions to keep you engaged",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to the where you will get the best chance to be become the superhero to fight with villain heroes and gangsters.Being a flying superhero you have the mission to be a evil fighting champion of the city/country that has fallen prey to evil powers. Play new offline flash game 2023 of action as a powerful flash hero. Playing this city fighting game you will be real flash hero fighting against villains and  rescue the city people help them and fly them to some safe place and hospitals.Be on the rescue mission and fight bad people in the city. Being a flying super speed hero 2020 you have powers to fly over a city and help the peoples and fight the gangsters in city. you are not just a warrior but you also a superhero and last hope of the city.<br>In this flying superhero flash hero survival mission game you are Speed lightning flying hero has to defeat these super villains. Become a light hero or speed hero of super hero games in super city and fighting with gangster and save the city people. The city is attacked by mafia gangsters and they are spreading terror in city this time will fighting flying speed hero with your kung fu hero fighting skills. It&#39;s time to show everyone your supernatural flying and speed hero powers and rescuing citizen of the city. <br>Their are Multiple missions to complete the levels:<br>Women is injured by gangsters fight the gangster and rescue the women to the hospital.<br>save a man injured in accident from car which is gain fire.<br>Save the injured lady and take it to hospital.<br>This flying flash superhero games has specially designed for Lovers of speed super hero games.Use your flying skills flying is fast  has to fight to complete city rescue mission.Fly over the city to the ultimate height for searching and rescuing people in emergency situation and take them to ambulance. Be the futuristic flash robot hero and fight bravely with the criminals to save the city. Show off your super combat skills,kung fu skill, boxing skill, kicking skill and flying skills.<br>Fight with gangster to save the city.<br>Features of super hero flying game 2023 :<br>- Multiple challenging missions to get complete.<br>- Jump , run and save yourself from gangsters for your survival.<br>- Best HD 3D graphics city environment.<br>- Multiple panther heroes to select<br>- Amazing background sound effects.<br>- Realistic Graphics<br>- City environment to give a realistic look<br>- Simple and easy controls to fly and fight crime<br>- challenging missions to keep you engaged",
